<title>UK: Veba AG sets 1.0 bln mark EMTN Programme.</title>
<headline>Veba AG sets 1.0 bln mark EMTN Programme.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>German utility Veba AG has launched a 1.0 billion mark Euro Medium Term Note Programme, Morgan Guaranty Trust Company of New York said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>Veba AG is based in Dusseldorf and Berlin.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7718</p>
</text>
